# Supreme Phantom gives +1/+1 to other Spirits its controller controls: Bot1's Mausoleum Wanderer (1/1 Spirit) becomes 2/2,
# while the Phantom itself stays 1/3 with flying (CR 613.4c; "other"), Bot1's Healer's Hawk (a Bird, not a Spirit) stays
# 1/1, and Bot2's Mausoleum Wanderer (a Spirit, but not Bot1's) stays 1/1 ("you control"). Phantom is cast first so
# Bot1's Wanderer entering does not trigger its own "another Spirit" ability.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Supreme Phantom
Mausoleum Wanderer
Healer's Hawk
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
